  <item>
    <title>EP18. 什么是爱？如何找到爱？《爱的对谈》(上)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686dd5ac93fd2d72b83f57a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686dd5ac93fd2d72b83f57a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 02:37:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>爱到底是什么？怎么能找到它啊！这个千古难题被</span><strong><span>《爱的对谈》</span></strong><span>这本书讲的明明白白。英国专栏作者</span><strong><span>娜塔莎·伦恩</span></strong><span>通过访谈，采访了形形色色的人类对爱的体会，字字珠玑！真希望我能早点读到这本书~</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你曾怀疑自己是否值得被爱，或者你正在学习找到爱，欢迎一起来听这期播客！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 娜塔莎自己的故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> </span><strong><span>认识真实的自己，是爱的起点</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">07:56</a> 海豹电台黄天怡“童话课”给我的启迪</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 朱诺·道森：做自己，比不孤单更重要</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> 阿依莎·马利克：</span><strong><span>爱的多样性，爱，不只是爱情</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">26:36</a> </span><strong><span>到底如何找到爱？实操建议来了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Taylor Swift-《Lover》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6771fbe11e823e72d3c3737c/lgVA5erX3Im15tSPBwcabHbQhs4c.m4a" length="32195786" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjyqG8vVXyauKETXCOEjbdcdec83.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
