  <item>
    <title>EP11. 毛毛往事：那些阿姨留下的温暖与故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d920ffdd11f9c8c15edb6b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d920ffdd11f9c8c15edb6b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Mar 2025 07:57:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>0-3岁，家里热闹非凡。一个小家伙的降临，让新手爸妈手忙脚乱，不得不开启依靠阿姨的“救世主”模式。选阿姨、换阿姨，有快乐事，也有糟心事……那些与阿姨相处的点滴，都成了珍贵的回忆。本期播客，带你走进那些温暖的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> </span><strong><span>马达“发言”</span></strong><span>：马达听懂人话了！它也要来说两句儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> </span><strong><span>月嫂的美味记忆</span></strong><span>：月嫂做的饭菜，让我念念不忘。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> </span><strong><span>第一位育儿嫂</span></strong><span>：因为这份生日礼物，我和阿姨又续了一个月。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="624">10:24</a> </span><strong><span>换阿姨</span></strong><span>：换阿姨的经历真的是开盲盒！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> </span><strong><span>第二位育儿嫂</span></strong><span>：阿姨不仅育儿，也</span><strong><span>育我</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> </span><strong><span>情商高有多重要</span></strong><span>：回避冲突型人格VS高情商阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a> </span><strong><span>妈妈婆婆都在家</span></strong><span>：小温-总统来了我都躺着！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>天元公园摘的满满一袋子苜蓿野菜</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjJ86HpmtctvE7eqKDZnil58gM9h.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>苜蓿肉馅儿大包子！</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvF-ShJIpvh8V1qYFvjusQxQ_bkt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：毛毛专属BGM《摇篮曲》by勃拉姆斯</span></p>]]></description>
