    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你能想象吗？小温曾经胖到接近180斤！然而，短短半年，他成功瘦身到120斤！今天，他将分享自己的减肥秘籍，带你一起见证奇迹！</span></p><span></span><p><span>是什么支撑他一路坚持？是偶像的力量，是突破自我的勇气，更是找到自信的决心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>运动的男人，最帅！~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 过劳肥、幸福肥，肚子upupup</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 神奇之书-看完这本书你就能戒烟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 第一个月，一天没落下，竟然只瘦了5斤？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> 你见过凌晨四点钟的洛杉矶吗？小温眼眶湿润了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 第二个月，甜蜜期，暴瘦15斤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 为什么节食减肥不可取？身体很聪明，不停找到新的平衡点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 第三个月，瓶颈期来了怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 爱上骑行，新的角度看“大北京”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-5DcwzVfGUhV0T6nEzIrwAGCiT.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>珍贵的体重数据记录</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmlZQfB6paEeuipzdoMkDcSjZeco.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>自行车仿佛让家里逼格也高起来了-，-</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FshqckEDl5X97JUT2-zP0Rfru-AP.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>首钢大桥</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqdNggKgV92ElxVyZq_ZeCLu_KVV.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>恐怖的“午门”</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FprVcWEfsaCtc1_Cf6rTj3JWGfOs.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>追风少年~速度三十迈 心情是自由自在</span></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://v.afbcs.cn/qJSMiH" data-url="https://v.afbcs.cn/qJSMiH"><span>【视频】小温的骑行VLOG</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：<